=1 1 13
+    ARM port of KE/MIPS/EXCEPTN.C. A breakpoint exception carries the
+    breakpoint code in its first parameter (ke\trapc.c), as the MIPS break
+    code is. The misaligned references that ARMv7 does not perform in
+    hardware are emulated (ke\alignem.c), by default in user and in kernel
+    mode as on Alpha: Microsoft C for ARM moves data as the alignment of
+    its type allows. The VFPv4 unit implements IEEE arithmetic completely,
+    so there is no floating point emulation.
=1 13 9
=1 24 4
